49.question:
What does the following Java function perform?
(Assume int occupies four bytes of storage)
public static int f(int a)
{ // Pre-conditions : a>0 and no overflow/underflow occurs
    int b=0 ;
    for (int i=0; i<32; i++)
    {
        b=b<<1 ;
        b=b | (a & 1);
        a=a>>>1; // This is a logical shift
    }
    return b;
}

